<view class="page">
  <view class="card brand-card">
    <image class="brand-logo" src="/CalCal_logo.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <view class="brand-copy">
      <view class="brand-name">{{appName}}</view>
      <view class="brand-sub">{{tagline}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card profile-card">
    <button class="avatar-btn" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="chooseAvatar" loading="{{uploading}}">
      <image wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" class="avatar big" src="{{avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" />
      <view wx:else class="avatar big avatar-text">{{initial}}</view>
      <view class="avatar-tip">点击更换头像</view>
    </button>

    <view class="name-row">
      <input
        class="input"
        type="nickname"
        placeholder="设置昵称"
        value="{{nickname}}"
        maxlength="20"
        bindinput="onNickname"
      />
      <button class="btn primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">保存</button>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="banner error">{{error}}</view>

    <view class="muted small user-id">用户 ID：{{user.id || '—'}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="devices-title">我的设备</view>
    <view wx:if="{{devicesLoading}}" class="muted">正在读取…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{deviceError}}" class="banner error">{{deviceError}}</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{!devices.length}}" class="muted">还没有绑定设备。连接设备并完成配对后会出现在这里。</view>
    <view wx:else>
      <view wx:for="{{devices}}" wx:key="did" class="device-row">
        <view class="device-row-main">
          <view class="device-row-name">{{item.name || '未命名设备'}}</view>
          <view class="device-row-meta">
            <text wx:if="{{item.boundLabel}}">绑定于 {{item.boundLabel}}</text>
            <text
              class="unbind-link {{unbinding ? 'disabled' : ''}}"
              data-did="{{item.did}}"
              data-pid="{{item.pid}}"
              bindtap="unbindDevice"
              aria-role="button"
              aria-label="解绑设备"
            >解绑</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="kv"><text>应用</text><text>{{appName}}</text></view>
    <view class="kv"><text>登录方式</text><text>微信登录</text></view>
    <view class="kv"><text>接口地址</text><text class="mono">{{apiBase}}</text></view>
    <view class="kv"><text>客户端版本</text><text>{{version}}</text></view>
    <view class="kv"><text>设备协议</text><text>proto {{protocol}}</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="card explain">
    <view class="explain-title">关于设备归属</view>
    <view class="explain-text">
      登录用于账号身份识别和云端日程归属。日程保存在云端，连接设备后自动双向同步；设备端删除也会同步删除云端对应日程。
    </view>
    <view class="explain-text">
      BLE 连接使用一次性配对码认证并加密指令和日程。设备首次配对后会归属当前微信账号；其他账号即使重新物理配对，也无法通过小程序同步云端日程。
      解绑只会解除云端归属，不会清除设备上的 BLE 密钥；要阻止本机继续连接，请再到设备上长按 CONFIRM 8 秒。
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn danger block" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button>
</view>
